    "duration": 7,
    "lines": [
      "A VPS is an isolated virtual machine.",
      "It gets its own operating system",
      "and a resource allocation."
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "comparison",
    "duration": 8,
    "lines": [
      "Shared usually costs less.",
      "VPS gives you more control",
      "and allocated resources.",
      "Shared is typically easier to manage."
    ]
